          "url": "https://huggingface.co/blog/nvidia/nemotron-transcribe-granary",
          "icon": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "fusion",
      "title": "Copilot 尝试自动切换本地与云端模型",
      "titleId": "fusion-title",
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "text": "Fusion 本地路由进入可选实验预览，CLI 可接本地 OpenAI 兼容服务中的指定模型。",
          "variant": ""
        },
        {
          "text": "能减少手动切换，但路由决策仍在云端，不能当作离线或纯本地隐私方案。",
          "variant": "takeaway"
        }
      ],
      "sourceDate": "2026-10-28",
      "dateLabel": "10 月 28 日公告",
      "eventDate": null,
      "sourcePublishedAt": null,
      "sources": [
        {
          "label": "GitHub 官方说明",
          "url": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-10-28-github-copilot-fusion-now-supports-selection-of-local-models/",
          "icon": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "lockfiles",
      "title": "GitHub Actions 锁文件正式可用",
      "titleId": "lockfiles-title",
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "text": "Free 计划也支持。工作流保留易读标签，实际执行锁定的提交，连传递依赖一起固定；Dependabot 可同步更新。",
          "variant": ""
        },
        {
          "text": "个人项目的 CI 和发布流程能少受上游标签移动影响，但锁定本身不代表依赖安全。",
          "variant": "takeaway"
        }
      ],
      "sourceDate": "2026-10-28",
      "dateLabel": "10 月 28 日发布",
      "eventDate": null,
      "sourcePublishedAt": null,
      "sources": [
        {
          "label": "GitHub 发布说明",
          "url": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-10-28-github-actions-workflow-lockfiles-are-generally-available/",
          "icon": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "node",
      "title": "Node.js 26 进入 LTS",
      "titleId": "node-title",
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "text": "26.13.0 代号 Lithium，支持到 2029 年 4 月底。相比 26.12.1 只调整 LTS 元数据，没有新增功能。",
          "variant": ""
        },
        {
          "text": "准备升级运行时或容器镜像可开始兼容性验证；从旧 LTS 迁移的 Linux 环境需留意 libatomic 依赖。",
          "variant": "takeaway"
        }
      ],
      "sourceDate": "2026-10-28",
      "dateLabel": "10 月 28 日发布",
      "eventDate": null,
      "sourcePublishedAt": null,
      "sources": [
        {
          "label": "Node.js 发布说明",
          "url": "https://nodejs.org/uk/blog/release/v26.13.0",
          "icon": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "dpapi",
      "title": "Windows 开发者需检查旧加密交互流程",
      "titleId": "dpapi-title",
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "text": "Windows 11 26H1 可选预览更新 KB5127653 提示：DPAPI 带提示框的保护/解保护流程将在 2027 年 4 月退役，相关应用需提前迁移现有数据。",
          "variant": ""
        },
        {
          "text": "不使用该交互流程的 DPAPI 不受影响；这也不是 Windows 10 更新。",
          "variant": "takeaway"
        }
      ],
      "sourceDate": "2026-10-28",
      "dateLabel": "10 月 28 日预览更新",
      "eventDate": null,
      "sourcePublishedAt": null,
